 451:  * adapter is free to be a class instance or to sit on an authored prototype, and its methods would
 452:  * live one link up. What is never the adapter's own work is what every object already has, so the
 453:  * walk stops exactly there. Today's live adapter is a plain object literal, so both readings agree on
