 313:           # Refer to other items IN WORDS: "the item that landed the relay".
 314:           #
 315:           # The hazard punishes good practice â€” the better the write-up, the more items it cites,
 316:           # and the most-cited item is the one somebody is actively working. Nothing checked that
 317:           # the pull request had any relationship to the item it closed, which is the same
 318:           # asserted-but-unobserved state this repository's way of work exists to delete.
