terra's single seat stands; flash seat FAILED-TO-LAND, named in the audit brief |\n284: | S1-1 | critical | accept — 
the proof travels into `writeAttestation` |\n285: | S1-2 | high | accept — brand validation in the clock and email 
constructors |\n286: | S1-3 | high | accept in part — inherited-method check tightened; any-name half rejected 
(typecheck + cast threat model) |\n287: | S1-4 | high | accept — `has` answers true for string properties; omitted 
