recorded in `verify-first.md`\n57: Part C, and the narrowed claim — in-transaction rollback is not externally drivable 
on the\n58: deployed surface — joins the audit claim checklist verbatim. Extending the shared SUT contract\n59: for 
one operator-authority arm would put a method on every tier's surface for a claim this tier\n60: does not 
require.\n61: \n62: ## RF-6 — `src/routeTree.gen.ts` regeneration: CORRECT HANDLING, recorded\n63: \n64: `bun run 
