did not prepare.\",\n    );\n  }\n\n  const attestation: LiveAttestation = {\n    evidence: `${label}: the database at 
the supplied coordinates answered with this run's runner-minted attestation nonce`,\n    constructedFor: 
SLOT_ATTESTATION_BRAND,\n  };\n  return stampAttestation({ ...attestation }, attestation);\n}\n\n/** The coordinates a 
child was handed, read off its own environment. Absent values stay empty. */\nexport function 
