MAIL CATCHER — the integration tier's `vendors.email`.\n3:  *\n4:  * WHAT IT IS AND IS NOT, first, because the name 
invites the wrong reading. This is NOT a real email\n5:  * PROVIDER, and no green anywhere in this repository claims 
one. Nothing here sends mail through a\n6:  * vendor at any tier. What the slot's stack really holds is the catcher 
every message the local\n7:  * Supabase Auth emits lands in, and READING it is a genuine capability: the confirmation 
