`bun run at:verify req-0NN --tier <loop|integration|drill>`.\n3:  *\n4:  * The command shape is fixed: all 30 
decomposition manifests cite it verbatim in their done\n5:  * contracts, and the skills (`/dev-start`'s inner loop, 
`/dev-end`, `/pm-done`'s gate) call it.\n6:  * It resolves the requirement's suite, runs it under vitest with the tier 
