hostname(),\n415:           requirement,\n416:           startedAt: new Date().toISOString(),\n417:           // A 
takeover recorded ONLY on the console is lost the moment the terminal scrolls. The\n418:           // claim file 
outlives the run that wrote it, so whoever reads it later can see that this\n419:           // occupancy began by 
displacing an abandoned one, and whose.\n420:           ...(displaced\n421:             ? {\n422:                 
