is a declared batch with the partner it closes; the reviewer was deliberately not told\n212: a batch exists — the 
gate's blindness working as designed — so the finding correctly applies a\n213: rule whose one exception it could not 
know. The \"other added files\" half is ruled at flash F4.\n214: No change.\n215: \n216: ## Slice 2 — reader flash, 5 
