'notifications.between_transition_and_event_write' is AT-016.09's point.\n106:    * MUST reject a point that is not in 
points().\n107:    */\n108:   at(point: string, kind: 'crash' | 'reject' | 'lose_ack'): Promise<FaultHandle>;\n109:   
/** kill and restart the delivery process mid-flight (AT-016.07) */\n110:   processRestart(): Promise<void>;\n111:   
/** identity of the delivery process; MUST change across processRestart() */\n112:   processEpoch(): 
Promise<string>;\n113: };\n114: \n115: /**\n116:  * Out-of-band evidence: static facts about the product source, not 
self-report from the SUT.\n117:  * AT-016.01's sole-writer claim is unfalsifiable if the only witnesses are 
