every tier, so it is typed at the tier with the RICHEST\n876:  * capabilities — the loop tier, whose clock can be 
commanded and whose vendor seam can be armed.\n877:  * That keeps every suite in this tree compiling unchanged, and it 
means the type system does NOT\n878:  * stop a single body from commanding a clock that, above loop, is the passage of 
time.\n879:  *\n880:  * WHAT DOES STOP IT is the per-tier form: an id whose procedure differs above loop supplies 
