about real time and real mail. An id that needs it and does not take it fails at run\n884:  * time rather than at 
compile time, and the fix is to write the body, not to widen the type.\n885:  */\n886: type AtTestFn = {\n887:   <R 
extends SuiteId, K extends SutKeyOf<R>>(\n888:     atId: string,\n889:     title: string,\n890:     opts: 
